docs/private/
.DS_Store

# Build output and IDE caches, wherever they appear.
#
# firmware/drone_box/.gitignore already covers these for that project, but it
# only applies while that directory is the one checked out. Standing on a
# branch where the firmware lives under a different name leaves a previous
# build's output unignored -- which is how a `build/` tree and clangd's index,
# some 2000 files, once came to be offered up as a commit. These patterns hold
# whatever the directory is called.
**/build/
**/build-host/
**/.cache/
**/managed_components/
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old
compile_commands.json
